  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Short instructions",
   "texto": [
    "In a direct instruction the imperative is used: **Les teksten** («Read the text»), **Skriv svaret** («Write the answer»). In many verbs the **-e** is removed from the infinitive: **å fylle → fyll**.",
    "After **skal, kan** and **må**, the infinitive is used: **Du må fylle ut skjemaet** («You have to fill out the form.»). The imperative is direct; you can soften it with **kan du …?**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Forms",
   "texto": [
    "**Fylle ut et skjema** means «fill out a form». **Sett kryss** is «mark with a cross». The Norwegian noun usually carries the defined form glued to the end: **skjema → skjemaet**."
   ]
  },
